# QUIET acknowledgements and @chownall's summary. AreQuiet(player, thing) and IsQuiet(x)
# (pennmush hdrs/dbdefs.h:197-198) gate do_set_atr (src/attrib.c:2446), do_edit (src/set.c:936),
# do_parent (src/set.c:1488), do_link's "Home set." (src/create.c:419), set_flag (src/flags.c:1855,
# 1914), set_power (src/flags.c:1978) and @notify/@drain's quiet_notify (src/cque.c:1509-1541).
# do_chownall says "Ownership changed for %d objects." (src/wiz.c:1002). @edit is in the QUIET cases
# only: its unsuppressed line ("QA - Set: beta") is a separate gap.

::case quiet.loud  a player who is not QUIET hears every acknowledgement
::login wiz Wiz wizpass
::as wiz
@pcreate Quinn=quinnpass
::login quinn Quinn quinnpass
::as quinn
@create QT1
@create QT2
&QA QT1=alpha
@desc QT1=A thing.
@parent QT1=QT2
@link QT1=me
@notify QT1
@drain QT1
&QA QT1

::case quiet.player  a QUIET player hears none of them
@set me=QUIET
&QA QT1=alpha
@set QT1=QB:gamma
@desc QT1=A quiet thing.
@edit QT1/QA=alpha,beta
@parent QT1=none
@link QT1=me
@set QT1=DARK
@notify QT1
@drain QT1
&QA QT1
@set me=!QUIET

::case quiet.thing  nor does the owner of a QUIET object, about that object
@set QT1=QUIET
&QA QT1=alpha
@set QT1=QB:delta
@edit QT1/QA=alpha,beta
@parent QT1=QT2
@link QT1=me
@set QT1=!DARK
@set QT1=!QUIET

::case quiet.power  set_power reports to the grantor unless the object is QUIET and theirs
::as wiz
@create QP
@set QP=QUIET
@power QP=Builder
@set QP=!QUIET
@power QP=!Builder

::case quiet.chownall  @chownall tells the executor how many objects it moved
@chownall *Quinn
think [owner(locate(*Quinn,QT1,i))]
